 Task 1 & Task 2: Enrollment Form Implementation

# Step 38: Generate Component and Setup Routing

Generate the enrollment form component via CLI:

```bash
ng generate component pages/enrollment-form

```

If your project uses modern **standalone routing** (`app.routes.ts`), add the route as follows:

# `src/app/app.routes.ts`

```typescript
import { Routes } from '@angular/router';

export const routes: Routes = [
  { path: 'enroll', loadComponent: () => import('./pages/enrollment-form/enrollment-form.component').then(m => m.EnrollmentFormComponent) },
  { path: '', redirectTo: 'enroll', pathMatch: 'full' }
];

```

*(If using traditional `app-routing.module.ts`, add `{ path: 'enroll', component: EnrollmentFormComponent }` to your `routes` array).*

